        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFBD5000, Decorative Universal Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's Solid Brass 2-1/8 Inch Decorative Universal Door Stop has a contemporary style. This universal door bumper is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. It is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"149\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFBD500-specifications.gif?v=1704354554\" width=\"149\" height=\"186\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana UFBD5000 Decorative Universal Door Stop\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-5-8-inch-decorative-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufbd4505\">Decorative Universal Door Stop</a></b> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-door-stop-ring-deltana-ufb4505rub\">Replacement Rubber Ring</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFBD5000 Decorative Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Height of Rubber from Floor: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Dark Gray</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: #12 x 1-1/2\" screw plus plastic anchor.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 2-1/8 Inch Decorative Universal Door Stop",
                "description": "Decorative Universal Door Stop, Deltana UFBD5000 - Deltana's Solid Brass 2-1/8 Inch Decorative Universal Door Stop has a contemporary style. This universal door bumper is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. It is easy to install with the included mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well. Available in 9 great finishes.",
